			"notes": "## NEXUS Bodycam 1.4.2+1.20.1 (Minecraft 1.20.1 / Fabric / client-side)\n\nBodycam-style camera overhaul: audio-synced footsteps, breathing with sound, lens/post-FX pipeline, realistic water and optional TACZ weapon realism.\n\n### Install\n1. Install Fabric Loader >= 0.15.11 for Minecraft **1.20.1**\n2. Add **Fabric API** to the mods folder\n3. Drop `NEXUS-bodycam-1.4.2+1.20.1.jar` into mods\n4. Optional: Mod Menu (config screen), TACZ (weapon realism), Iris (shaders)\n\nFull instructions: https://github.com/jhfuheuiwfh/nexus-bodycam-mod/wiki/Installation\n\n### Changes\n- v1.4.2: aim vector sign fix (raycast pointed to the opposite side)\n- v1.4.1: config UI rebuilt (scrolling headers, viewport clipping, custom sliders) + crosshair/block-break alignment\n- v1.4.0: 4 new presets (Documentary, Horror, Tactical, Raw GoPro)\n\nFull log: https://github.com/jhfuheuiwfh/nexus-bodycam-mod/blob/main/docs/CHANGELOG.md\n\n### Checksum\nSHA-256: 5B0120B49A82046104EAEE6B891675D75CFCE8AEDB16C3D4C55398A31C7360D8\n\n### AI disclosure\nThis project contains AI-generated content (code, assets and text); some code was also modified by hand by the author. See https://github.com/jhfuheuiwfh/nexus-bodycam-mod/blob/main/AI-TRANSPARENCY.md\n\n### License\nGPL-3.0"
